o results.":["Nincs tal\u00e1lat."],"Retry loading styles":["St\u00edlusok bet\u00f6lt\u00e9s\u00e9nek \u00fajrapr\u00f3b\u00e1l\u00e1sa"],"Alias of %s":["A(z) %s aliasa"],"%1$s, alias of %2$s":["%1$s, a(z) %2$s aliasa"],"Create %s":["%s l\u00e9trehoz\u00e1sa"],"Alias":["Alias"],"Toggle style list":["St\u00edluslista \u00e1tkapcsol\u00e1sa"],"Loading styles\u2026":["St\u00edlusok bet\u00f6lt\u00e9se\u2026"],"Showing %1$d of %2$d matching styles. Keep typing to narrow results.":["A tal\u00e1latok k\u00f6z\u00fcl %1$d\/%2$d st\u00edlus megjelen\u00edt\u00e9se. A tal\u00e1latok sz\u0171k\u00edt\u00e9s\u00e9hez folytassa a g\u00e9pel\u00e9st."],"Other":["Egy\u00e9b"],"Showing the first %1$d of %2$d styles. Type to search all styles.":["A st\u00edlusok k\u00f6z\u00fcl az els\u0151 %1$d megjelen\u00edt\u00e9se (%2$d). Az \u00f6sszes st\u00edlus keres\u00e9s\u00e9hez kezdjen g\u00e9pelni."],":root is managed in Design Tokens.":["A :root kezel\u00e9se a tervez\u00e9si tokenekn\u00e9l t\u00f6rt\u00e9nik."],"Use one base selector or an :is()\/:where() group. Add states, modifiers, and relationships as nested rules.":["Haszn\u00e1ljon egy alapszelektort vagy egy :is()\/:where() csoportot. Az \u00e1llapotokat, m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00f3kat \u00e9s kapcsolatokat adja meg be\u00e1gyazott szab\u00e1lyokk\u00e9nt."],"Style name is not valid.":["A st\u00edlus neve \u00e9rv\u00e9nytelen."],"Create %1$s, then add %2$s as a nested rule.":["Hozza l\u00e9tre a(z) %1$s elemet, majd adja hozz\u00e1 a(z) %2$s elemet be\u00e1gyazott szab\u00e1lyk\u00e9nt."],"That selector already belongs to %s. Save a pending removal before reusing it.":["Ez a szelektor m\u00e1r a(z) %s elemhez tartozik. Az \u00fajb\u00f3li haszn\u00e1lat el\u0151tt mentse a f\u00fcgg\u0151ben l\u00e9v\u0151 elt\u00e1vol\u00edt\u00e1st."],"The Global Style selector is not valid.":["A glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlus szelektora \u00e9rv\u00e9nytelen."],"Additional selectors must be a list.":["A tov\u00e1bbi szelektoroknak list\u00e1nak kell lenni\u00fck."],"An additional selector is not a valid CSS selector.":["Egy tov\u00e1bbi szelektor nem \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes CSS-szelektor."],":root cannot be an additional selector.":["A :root nem lehet tov\u00e1bbi szelektor."],"The primary selector cannot also be an additional selector.":["Az els\u0151dleges szelektor nem lehet egyben tov\u00e1bbi szelektor is."],"Each additional selector must be unique.":["Minden tov\u00e1bbi szelektornak egyedinek kell lennie."],"%s created.":["%s l\u00e9trehozva."],"Style":["St\u00edlus"],"Global Style":["Glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlus"],"Failed to load styles.":["A st\u00edlusok bet\u00f6lt\u00e9se sikertelen."],"Enter style name":["Adja meg a st\u00edlus nev\u00e9t"],"This style has already been added.":["Ezt a st\u00edlust m\u00e1r hozz\u00e1adta."],"Invalid selector.":["Hib\u00e1s szelektor."],"Hide create or add new style":["\u00daj st\u00edlus l\u00e9trehoz\u00e1s\u00e1nak vagy hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1s\u00e1nak elrejt\u00e9se"],"Create or add new style":["\u00daj st\u00edlus l\u00e9trehoz\u00e1sa vagy hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa"],"This Global Style is a Button block inside the \"Buttons\" block and may not work with this standalone Button.":["Ez a glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlus egy gombblokk a \u201egombok\u201d blokkon bel\u00fcl, \u00e9s el\u0151fordulhat, hogy nem m\u0171k\u00f6dik ezzel az \u00f6n\u00e1ll\u00f3 gombbal."],"This Global Style is a standalone Button and may not work with this Button block inside the \"Buttons\" block.":["Ez a glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlus egy \u00f6n\u00e1ll\u00f3 gomb, \u00e9s el\u0151fordulhat, hogy nem m\u0171k\u00f6dik a \u201egombok\u201d blokkon bel\u00fcli gombblokkal."],"This Global Style is using the legacy layout system and may not work with this Container block.":["Ez a glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlus a r\u00e9gi elrendez\u00e9si rendszert haszn\u00e1lja, ez\u00e9rt el\u0151fordulhat, hogy nem m\u0171k\u00f6dik ezzel a kont\u00e9nerblokkal."],"This Global Style is using the new layout system and may not work with this Container block.":["Ez a glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlus az \u00faj elrendez\u00e9si rendszert haszn\u00e1lja, ez\u00e9rt el\u0151fordulhat, hogy nem m\u0171k\u00f6dik ezzel a kont\u00e9nerblokkal."],"Legacy Global Styles":["R\u00e9gi glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlusok"],"The below option is using our legacy Global Styles feature.":["Az al\u00e1bbi be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s a r\u00e9gi glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlusok funkci\u00f3t haszn\u00e1lja."],"Use Legacy Global Style":["R\u00e9gi glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlus haszn\u00e1lata"],"This will remove all local styling from this block.":["Ezzel elt\u00e1vol\u00edtja a blokk \u00f6sszes helyi st\u00edlus\u00e1t."],"Name your global style something short and unique to this type of block.":["Adjon r\u00f6vid, egyedi nevet a glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlusnak, amely illik ehhez a blokkt\u00edpushoz."],"Change Global Style ID":["Glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlus ID m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sa"],"Changing this ID will remove the styling from existing blocks using this Global Style.":["Az ID m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1val elt\u00e1vol\u00edtja a st\u00edlust azokr\u00f3l a megl\u00e9v\u0151 blokkokr\u00f3l, amelyek ezt a glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlust haszn\u00e1lj\u00e1k."],"Label":["C\u00edmke"],"The label shown when choosing a Global Style in the editor.":["A szerkeszt\u0151ben a glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlus kiv\u00e1laszt\u00e1sakor megjelen\u0151 c\u00edmke."],"Property":["Tulajdons\u00e1g"],"Value":["\u00c9rt\u00e9k"],"Edit Source":["Forr\u00e1s szerkeszt\u00e9se"],"This panel has controls that inherit global styles":["Ez a panel olyan vez\u00e9rl\u0151ket tartalmaz, amelyek \u00f6r\u00f6klik a glob\u00e1lis st\u00edlusokat."],"Global":["Glob\u00e1lis"],"Select Category":["Kateg\u00f3ria kiv\u00e1laszt\u00e1sa"],"Blocks":["Blokkok"],"Patterns":["Blokkmint\u00e1k"],"This is our legacy Pattern Library. It is still available to you as you have legacy local patterns.":["Ez a r\u00e9gi blokkmintak\u00f6nyvt\u00e1r. Mivel vannak r\u00e9gi, helyi blokkmint\u00e1i, tov\u00e1bbra is haszn\u00e1lhatja."],"We recommend using the new Pattern Library, instead.":["Javasoljuk, hogy ink\u00e1bb az \u00faj blokkmintak\u00f6nyvt\u00e1rat haszn\u00e1lja."],"Open New Pattern Library":["\u00daj blokkmintak\u00f6nyvt\u00e1r megnyit\u00e1sa"],"No patterns found.":["Nem tal\u00e1lhat\u00f3 blokkminta."],"Add Template":["Sablon hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa"],"Patterns: %s":["Blokkmint\u00e1k: %s"],"Requires GenerateBlocks %s":["A GenerateBlocks %s verzi\u00f3ja sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges"],"Requires GenerateBlocks Pro %s":["A GenerateBlocks Pro %s verzi\u00f3ja sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges"],"Pattern Library":["Blokkmintat\u00e1r"],"Insert pre-built patterns directly into your content.":["Sz\u00farjon be el\u0151re elk\u00e9sz\u00edtett blokkmint\u00e1kat k\u00f6zvetlen\u00fcl a tartalomba."],"Open Pattern Library":["Blokkmintat\u00e1r megnyit\u00e1sa"],"Pattern Library (Legacy)":["Blokkmintat\u00e1r (r\u00e9gi)"]}}}